
LispView Interface for the XView Textsw Module

Documentation: textedit.doc

Textedit interface:
   textedit-defs.lisp
   textedit.lisp
   xview-textedit.lisp

Loading the file build.lisp into a LispView image recompiles and
reloads the textedit interface.

Demo ("Cheap source code finder using textedit"): textedit-demo.lisp
